{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:18:155","content":{"id":155,"title":"第七课：着色I","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a3fed586-8fa9-40c0-b105-b6a574c86c70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"多个物体怎么画在画布上，参考画家，先绘制最远的物体，然后绘制近的，近的物体可以把远的物体遮盖住"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_646435cb-525b-4953-abb2-af7b8974127f.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_646435cb-525b-4953-abb2-af7b8974127f.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"08ca5a58-1626-4fbf-b3ab-1af18529ee7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aecb167c-6a20-44ef-9448-6d2022392257","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要先按照深度排序（"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n\\log n","collabId":"e4d03528-26e9-43dd-ba0e-49d1c07592d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n\\log n"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":")），存在无法解决的深度排序"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_054e2ae2-57e0-46c3-aed5-12354bc88bc6.png","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_054e2ae2-57e0-46c3-aed5-12354bc88bc6.png","width":522.916645887826,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"0a843edd-7ece-4dca-979e-3e4c30fd2371","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"901ac42c-7037-48a4-8631-030f9490e1a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"互相覆盖，无法定义深度关系。引入深度缓存（深度缓冲）